        "accession_number": "0001201792-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Because we do not have contracts with the DoD to provide instruction at overseas locations, service members who begin their first postsecondary education program after arrival at an applicable overseas location may not use TA to pay for their education in our programs until after they have already successfully completed a course with an institution that has entered into a contract to provide voluntary education programs at that overseas location.",
        "start_character": 180633,
        "end_character": 181083
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001201792-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001201792-26-000004-5f5874ebcf4bc723",
        "accession_number": "0001201792-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are focused on expanding nursing opportunities through geographic campus expansion and the expansion of our programs and course offerings.",
        "start_character": 35368,
        "end_character": 35509
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001201792-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001201792-26-000004-5f5874ebcf4bc723",
        "accession_number": "0001201792-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe service members will continue to seek respected universities that provide military-focused support services coupled with an online curriculum and flexible scheduling.",
        "start_character": 24597,
        "end_character": 24774
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001201792-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001201792-26-000004-5f5874ebcf4bc723",
        "accession_number": "0001201792-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer programs across a broad range of fields of study, including public service-focused fields such as nursing, national security, military studies, intelligence, and homeland security, as well as traditional academic fields such as business, health science, information technology, justice studies, education, and liberal arts.",
        "start_character": 38991,
        "end_character": 39323
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001201792-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001201792-26-000004-5f5874ebcf4bc723",
        "accession_number": "0001201792-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We seek to offer curriculum in bundles that resonate with service-minded students and their families.",
        "start_character": 34555,
        "end_character": 34656
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001201792-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001201792-26-000004-5f5874ebcf4bc723",
        "accession_number": "0001201792-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We strive to align our marketing efforts with our business and strategy and to tailor our marketing approach to our educational offerings and the students we serve.",
        "start_character": 60017,
        "end_character": 60181
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001201792-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001201792-26-000004-5f5874ebcf4bc723",
        "accession_number": "0001201792-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In 2025, we launched a condensed version of our annual survey to gain feedback on key areas of importance to our human capital management strategy, and we are implementing action plans to address areas of opportunities identified in those results.",
        "start_character": 76125,
        "end_character": 76372
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001201792-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001201792-26-000004-5f5874ebcf4bc723",
        "accession_number": "0001201792-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Our status as a market leader in key areas we serve means that we operate from a position of strength in those areas.",
        "start_character": 31917,
        "end_character": 32034
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001201792-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001201792-26-000004-5f5874ebcf4bc723",
        "accession_number": "0001201792-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "To maintain regulatory approval from the state board of nursing or equivalent body in the states that we operate, an educational program must maintain a certain pass rate on the relevant licensure exam, as defined by the state.",
        "start_character": 114331,
        "end_character": 114558
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001201792-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001201792-26-000004-5f5874ebcf4bc723",
        "accession_number": "0001201792-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also believe we may distinguish ourselves from our competitors by developing direct partnerships with healthcare providers as they become more involved in educating and training their future workforces, of which nurses are the largest segment.",
        "start_character": 27186,
        "end_character": 27432
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001201792-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001201792-26-000004-5f5874ebcf4bc723",
        "accession_number": "0001201792-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have designed our employee compensation and third-party contractual arrangements to comply with the incentive payment rule currently in effect.",
        "start_character": 147027,
        "end_character": 147173
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001201792-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001201792-26-000004-5f5874ebcf4bc723",
        "accession_number": "0001201792-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We will continue to develop capabilities to drive organic growth and plan to continue to assess and pursue strategic acquisitions and integrate and grow them for inorganic growth.",
        "start_character": 36874,
        "end_character": 37053
